  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zambia Human Development &amp; Governance Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#xb7;	To empower communities in the dioceses to actively engage in their development and demand responsive governance leading to greater accountability and service delivery.
&#xb7;	To empower communities in dioceses to challenge attitudes, systems and institutions that are impoverishing them, in order to attain sustainable livelihood.
&#xb7;	To increase social justice in the area of HIV/AIDS among the communities in the dioceses.
&#xb7;	To increase Christians&apos; participation in issues of social justice to create a more caring society
&#xb7;	To enhance capacity of CCJDP to deliver quality services to all the dioceses and wider society.</narrative>
  </description>
